r-ear headphones rests on the desk beside open books. Soft natural light streams through a window. The Chinese characters '倾听自然' (Listen to Nature) displayed in Wang Xizhi's elegant calligraphy style. Blending traditional Chinese elements with modern technology, warm color palette of browns, greens, and golds. Professional photography, high resolution, dramatic lighting, cinematic composition.","Stunning poster featuring vast golden rice fields under sunset, close-up of ripe rice grains glistening with dew, Chinese calligraphy \"粒粒皆辛苦\" prominently displayed in Yan Zhenqing's bold and dignified style, dramatic lighting with warm golden hour sun rays creating depth and contrast, rich textures of rice stalks and grains, composition emphasizing the beauty and hardship of farming, muted earth tones with golden accents, cinematic atmosphere conveying respect for farmers' labor, detailed rendering of rice paddies and harvest elements.","Badminton court background, dynamic action of players in mid-game, sweat droplets flying, dramatic lighting, \"流汗是福\" in large Chinese calligraphy style by Yan Zhenqing, bold powerful strokes, sweat glistening on skin, high energy sports atmosphere, vibrant colors, dramatic perspective, professional sports photography, motion blur effect, intense focus, competitive spirit, health and fitness theme, sweat as blessing concept."],"color":"#223","bgcolor":"#335"},{"id":92,"type":"CR Prompt Text","pos":[-90,1250],"size":[350,290],"flags":{"collapsed":false},"order":16,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"提示词","name":"prompt","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"prompt"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"label":"提示词文本","localized_name":"prompt","name":"prompt","type":"STRING","links":[146]},{"localized_name":"show_help","name":"show_help","type":"STRING","links":null}],"properties":{"cnr_id":"ComfyUI_Comfyroll_CustomNodes","ver":"d78b780ae43fcf8c6b7c6505e6ffb4584281ceca","Node name for S&R":"CR Prompt Text","widget_ue_connectable":{}},"widgets_values":["